<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Global Apps | ePAGPS</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#06131d; --bg2:#0b2032; --panel:rgba(16,29,41,.8);
      --text:#edf5ff; --muted:#bfd2ea; --primary:#4d93ff; --primary2:#7a5cff;
      --green:#36d07a; --line:rgba(255,255,255,.1); --shadow:0 18px 38px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box} html{scroll-behavior:smooth} body{
      margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top, #0d2238 0%, #081922 36%, #050d14 100%);
      color:var(--text); line-height:1.6;
    }
    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit} img{max-width:100%;display:block}
    .container{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:18px 0}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.04em}
    .brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary2));box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .brand-name{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1}
    .brand-name small{font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary2));color:#fff;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:none}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:22px;align-items:center;min-height:560px;padding:20px 0 24px}
    .eyebrow{display:inline-block;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(122,92,255,.35);border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(122,92,255,.08);color:#dfe8ff;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
    h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:14px 0 18px}
    .lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.06rem;max-width:600px}
    .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .card-panel{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .panel-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
    .live{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .live-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(54,208,122,.8)}
    .map{position:relative;height:260px;margin-top:16px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(80,140,255,.12),rgba(122,92,255,.08));overflow:hidden}
    .map::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.04) 1px, transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.04) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:22px 22px}
    .pin{position:absolute;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(54,208,122,.14)}
    .pin.one{top:26%;left:28%}.pin.two{top:52%;left:56%}.pin.three{top:68%;left:74%}
    .route{position:absolute;inset:0;margin:auto;width:70%;height:70%;border:2px dashed rgba(182,200,223,.7);border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(18deg)}
    .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .stat{padding:12px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px}
    .stat small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}
    .stat strong{font-size:1.05rem}
    section{padding:32px 0}
    h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0 12px}
    .section-head{margin-bottom:18px}
    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .item{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .icon{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700}
    .icon.purple{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary2),var(--primary))}
    .icon.blue{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#30b7ff,#4d93ff)}
    .tag{display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(77,147,255,.12);color:#dbeaff;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:14px}
    .item h3{margin:12px 0 8px;font-size:1.65rem}
    .item p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .item a{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-weight:700}
    .feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:22px;align-items:center}
    .feature ul{margin:18px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--text);line-height:2}
    .feature-box{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(77,147,255,.12),rgba(122,92,255,.1));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:24px;min-height:220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .feature-mark{font-size:2.2rem;color:#dfeaff}
    .feature-box p{margin:10px 0 0}
    .feature-box strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2vw,2rem);margin-top:8px}
    .feature-line{width:100%;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--primary),var(--primary2));margin:18px 0;border-radius:20px}
    .contact{margin-top:10px;padding:28px 0 40px}
    .contact-box{text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:28px 18px}
    .contact-box small{display:block;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 0 34px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
    @media (max-width:800px){
      .hero,.feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav{display:none}
      header{justify-content:space-between}
    }
    @media (max-width:500px){
      .actions{flex-direction:column}
      .btn{width:100%}
      .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      footer{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <a href="#" class="brand" aria-label="Global Apps">
        <span class="brand-mark">G</span>
        <span class="brand-name">Global Apps<small>ePAGPS</small></span>
      </a>

      <nav aria-label="Navegación principal">
        <a href="#apps">Apps</a>
        <a href="#epagps">ePAGPS</a>
      </nav>

      <a class="btn" href="#contacto">Contáctanos</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Tecnología para operar mejor</span>
          <h1>Tu operación, siempre a la vista.</h1>
          <p class="lead">Global Apps y ePAGPS centralizan la información clave para gestionar flotas, rutas, ubicación y operaciones con más claridad.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a href="#apps" class="btn">Explorar apps</a>
            <a href="#epagps" class="btn secondary">Conocer ePAGPS</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-panel">
          <div class="panel-top">
            <span class="live"><span class="live-dot"></span> Sistema conectado</span>
            <span>Vista general</span>
          </div>

          <div class="map">
            <span class="pin one"></span>
            <span class="pin two"></span>
            <span class="pin three"></span>
            <span class="route"></span>
          </div>

          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <small>Ubicación</small>
              <strong>En tiempo real</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <small>Gestión</small>
              <strong>Centralizada</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="apps">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Global Apps</span>
          <h2>Herramientas para simplificar tu día.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="item">
            <span class="icon purple">G</span>
            <span class="tag">Monitoreo</span>
            <h3>ePAGPS</h3>
            <p>Consulta ubicación, recorridos y movimientos de tus unidades con más control operativo.</p>
            <a href="#epagps">Más información →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="item">
            <span class="icon blue">A</span>
            <span class="tag">Gestión</span>
            <h3>Global Apps</h3>
            <p>Un acceso centralizado para conocer y activar las apps que apoyan tu operación diaria.</p>
            <a href="#contacto">Solicitar información →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="epagps" class="feature">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">ePAGPS</span>
          <h2>Información útil para tomar mejores decisiones.</h2>
          <p class="lead">ePAGPS te permite ver la ubicación y el movimiento de tus unidades desde un solo lugar, facilitando la coordinación y la toma de decisiones.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Seguimiento de unidades</li>
            <li>Consulta de recorridos</li>
            <li>Acceso centralizado a la información</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <span class="feature-mark">⌖</span>
          <p>Monitoreo GPS</p>
          <strong>Tu flota, más visible</strong>
          <div class="feature-line"></div>
          <small>Información de ubicación en un solo lugar</small>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contacto" class="contact">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <span class="eyebrow">¿Quieres saber más?</span>
          <h2>Hablemos de tu operación.</h2>
          <p class="lead">Contáctanos para conocer las soluciones de Global Apps y ePAGPS.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:info@example.com">Solicitar información</a>
          <small>Actualiza este correo con el contacto oficial de tu organización.</small>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>© Global Apps · ePAGPS</span>
      <a href="#top">Volver arriba ↑</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
